[PrintTextModified Text:事到如今再怎么吵闹，结果也不会改变。<br>米莉亚到底是不是凶手？<br>已经不是思考这个问题的时候了。|#CommonBad08_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR10,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Fearful_Closed
