[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚畏惧地叫喊着。|#CommonBad08_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:包括我在内，<br>在场的所有少女都感受着和她一样的心情。|#CommonBad08_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我们不得不作出选择。|#CommonBad08_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不这么做，<br>所有人都会死。|#CommonBad08_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.2
[PrintTextModified Text:大家只要按下手机上的处刑按钮，<br>就会开始执行处刑了。|#CommonBad08_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在典狱长的催促下，<br>我们只得接连按下按钮。|#CommonBad08_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

