@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.6 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:540_1
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:被拘束在十字架上的米莉亚的身影。|#CommonBad08_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经有数根长枪刺穿了她的身体。|#CommonBad08_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守摆出姿势，准备再次投掷长枪。|#CommonBad08_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:住手……住手……<br>我不想、死……求求你们……|#CommonBad08_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:剧痛、以及步步逼近的死亡所带来的恐惧——|#CommonBad08_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一定是无法估量的痛苦。<br>米莉亚扭曲的脸庞说明了一切。|#CommonBad08_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我……不是凶手……<br>什么都没做……却……|#CommonBad08_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚用尽全力般挤出的低语<br>回响在虚空中。|#CommonBad08_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样……太过分了……|#CommonBad08_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是她死前的最后一句话。|#CommonBad08_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

