[PrintTextModified Text:忽然，我感到背后有人靠近。<br>接着，背上传来一阵灼烧般的剧痛。|#CommonBad08_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我倒在了地上，仰望着天空。|#CommonBad08_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就是【这次】记忆的最后一幕——|#CommonBad08_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

